*.exe
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/wailsjs/
# go-task 的校验和缓存（wails3 task 每次构建都写）。
.task/
# wails3 自动生成的绑定。本项目不用它——命令层走 tools/protogen 生成的
# core/protocol/commands.ts（它按 CommandKinds 交叉核对，能挡住漏登记），
# 录音窗那几个方法走手写的 recorder/window-api.ts。留着只会让人以为有两套真相。
frontend/bindings/
frontend/package.json.md5
build/bin/
# Wails v3 的产物目录（v2 是 build/bin/）。exe 已被上面的 *.exe 覆盖，但 macOS 的
# .app 包与通用二进制没有扩展名，所以整个目录一并忽略。
bin/
# Runtime data and stray files created when the app is run from build/ as its CWD.
build/.runcode/
build/*.html
build/*.py
build/ppt_skill/
# dist/ is a build output — `wails build` / `npm run build` regenerates it, so
# none of it is committed. Only the empty .gitkeep is tracked, and solely so the
# directory survives a fresh clone: main.go's `//go:embed all:frontend/dist` needs
# the tree to exist and match at least one file, and the `all:` prefix is what
# makes a dot-file count. Without it `go build ./...` fails on a clean checkout.
# (index.html used to be committed as a placeholder, but it carries the hashed
# asset names, so every rebuild left the working tree dirty for no benefit.)
frontend/dist/*
!frontend/dist/.gitkeep
